= CurrentSensor <nflow_blocks:acausal_electrical.CurrentSensor>


#block-icon(image("CurrentSensor.svg"))

Measures the branch current p -\> n (ideal ammeter).

== Syntax

- #raw("Block type: CurrentSensor");

== Input argument

/ physical pins: 2 undirected physical pin(s); 0 signal input(s).

== Output argument

/ signal ports: 1 signal output(s) (sensor readings).

== Description

Measures the branch current p -\> n (ideal ammeter).

 

